  "description": "Roll over all sorts of difficult terrain with ease on the Argus Sport fat tire bike by Mongoose. This beast of a bike provides improved stability on sand, snow, or even slick roads. And the Argus' Tectonic T2 aluminum frame makes it lighter and stiffer than ever.\nTectonic T2 aluminum frame provides increased strength and decreased weight for a more rigid and responsive ride.\n10-speed Shimano Deore derailleur and shifter let you easily adapt to your terrain.\nHydraulic disc brakes provide reliable and responsive stopping power year-round while large 26\" x 4.8” tires provide maximum traction, even in snowy and sandy conditions.\nInternal cable routing allows for neat, clean lines while providing added protection. Suggested rider height range for this 17-inch/medium frame is 5'7\" to 5'11\".",
